{"v":"2026-11-07","src":"genshin-db 5.2.15","list":[{"id":"momiji-dyed-court","n":"Momiji-Dyed Court","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Inazuma","ty":"Artifacts","d":"At this altar where red leaves flutter in the wind, summer and autumn are separated into two spheres, one where Cryo is enhanced, the other where Pyro is enhanced.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_ThunderCave_Dq","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["shimenawas-reminiscence","emblem-of-severed-fate","resolution-of-sojourner","tiny-miracle"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Autumn Hunt"}]},{"id":"waterfall-wen","n":"Waterfall Wen","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Fontaine","ty":"Artifacts","d":"An ancient ruined city that was once used by a now-bygone secret order as an ad-hoc site of assembly.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_FDRelic01","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["song-of-days-past","nighttime-whispers-in-the-echoing-woods","tiny-miracle","martial-artist"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Crumbling Assembly"}]},{"id":"valley-of-remembrance","n":"Valley of Remembrance","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Mondstadt","ty":"Artifacts","d":"This ancient blessed altar is filled with monsters that fear pure, brute force.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Normal_3","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["tiny-miracle","traveling-doctor","viridescent-venerer","maiden-beloved"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Dance of Steel"}]},{"id":"derelict-masonry-dock","n":"Derelict Masonry Dock","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Natlan","ty":"Artifacts","d":"A once-magnificent design left abandoned to time. This desolate site, hidden deep within the mountain's heart, casts but a flickering shadow of its former grandiose creation.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_NTDungeon_Cycle01","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["long-nights-oath","finale-of-the-deep-galleries","tiny-miracle","scholar"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Deepfire Construct"}]},{"id":"frostladen-machinery","n":"Frostladen Machinery","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Nod-Krai","ty":"Artifacts","d":"A series of giant devices built to test certain principles or assumptions. After all conclusions were drawn, these structures lost their reason for being.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_NKDungeon_Cycle02","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["night-of-the-skys-unveiling","silken-moons-serenade","resolution-of-sojourner","gambler"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Derivations From the Deep"}]},{"id":"city-of-gold","n":"City of Gold","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Sumeru","ty":"Artifacts","d":"Lost and abandoned for centuries, the ruins of this city have become a resting place for paltry beings.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_XMRelic02","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["desert-pavilion-chronicle","flower-of-paradise-lost","resolution-of-sojourner","brave-heart"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Desert Citadel"}]},{"id":"peak-of-vindagnyr","n":"Peak of Vindagnyr","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Mondstadt","ty":"Artifacts","d":"This was once a ritual site close to the skies, but a frigid nail that descended from the firmament buried it into the mountainside.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Cold_1","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["blizzard-strayer","heart-of-depth","defenders-will","gambler"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Elegiac Rime"}]},{"id":"midsummer-courtyard","n":"Midsummer Courtyard","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Mondstadt","ty":"Artifacts","d":"This ancient blessed altar is filled with Pyro-fearing monsters.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Normal_1","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["resolution-of-sojourner","adventurer","thundering-fury","thundersoother"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Fires of Purification"}]},{"id":"thorny-crown-of-the-mountain-wind","n":"Thorny Crown of the Mountain Wind","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Mondstadt","ty":"Artifacts","d":"A floral realm hidden amidst the mountains, now seldom visited due to its remote location.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_MDDungeon_Cycle05","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["celestial-gift","disenchantment-in-deep-shadow","berserker","the-exile"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Flower Feast"}]},{"id":"molten-iron-fortress","n":"Molten Iron Fortress","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Sumeru","ty":"Artifacts","d":"A border city that used to provide shelter for desert folk displaced in an epidemic. Now, a new group of vagrants has taken up residence within its walls.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_XMRelic02","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["nymphs-dream","vourukashas-glow","martial-artist","scholar"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Forsaken Rampart"}]},{"id":"denouement-of-sin","n":"Denouement of Sin","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Fontaine","ty":"Artifacts","d":"After the accident at the Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering, many masterless constructs went out of control, wandering aimlessly about the caverns around the shore of the lake, waiting for orders that will never come.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_FDRelic01","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["marechaussee-hunter","golden-troupe","resolution-of-sojourner","defenders-will"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Harmony"}]},{"id":"inverted-glacier","n":"Inverted Glacier","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Snezhnaya","ty":"Artifacts","d":"A barren mountain scourged by eternal winter storms. Neither monster nor outlaw can long survive its ancient, desolate cold.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_ZDCircle_01","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["scarlet-proof","heart-of-the-furnace","the-exile","brave-heart"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Ice Erosion"}]},{"id":"the-lost-valley","n":"The Lost Valley","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Liyue","ty":"Artifacts","d":"This seems to have once been an ancient ritual site, but it has since been taken over by ruin machines from the outside.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_CycleDungeonChasm","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["vermillion-hereafter","echoes-of-an-offering","martial-artist","gambler"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Machine Nest"}]},{"id":"slumbering-court","n":"Slumbering Court","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Inazuma","ty":"Artifacts","d":"This masterless mansion has become the haunting ground of monsters from the rift.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_ThunderCave_Dq","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["husk-of-opulent-dreams","ocean-hued-clam","defenders-will","brave-heart"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Necropolis"}]},{"id":"hidden-palace-of-zhou-formula","n":"Hidden Palace of Zhou Formula","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Liyue","ty":"Artifacts","d":"The Ley Line Monolith inside this ancient Ley Line Altar is coveted by the monsters crowding the altar.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Normal_1","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["crimson-witch-of-flames","lavawalker","defenders-will","martial-artist"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Roaring Fire"}]},{"id":"moonchilds-treasures","n":"Moonchild's Treasures","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Nod-Krai","ty":"Artifacts","d":"A vault that once held the sparks of an ancient civilization, now taken over by villains seeking sacred relics along with the owls of the bedeviled skies.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_NKDungeon_Cycle03","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["aubade-of-morningstar-and-moon","a-day-carved-from-rising-winds","tiny-miracle","instructor"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Sacred Vault"}]},{"id":"spire-of-solitary-enlightenment","n":"Spire of Solitary Enlightenment","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Sumeru","ty":"Artifacts","d":"Bandits from the sea of sand lurk within this Domain.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_XMRelic01","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["deepwood-memories","gilded-dreams","tiny-miracle","gambler"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Seven Senses"}]},{"id":"domain-of-guyun","n":"Domain of Guyun","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Liyue","ty":"Artifacts","d":"The Ley Line Monolith inside this ancient Ley Line Altar is coveted by the monsters crowding the altar.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Normal_1","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["brave-heart","lucky-dog","archaic-petra","retracing-bolide"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Spring"}]},{"id":"clear-pool-and-mountain-cavern","n":"Clear Pool and Mountain Cavern","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Liyue","ty":"Artifacts","d":"This ancient blessed altar is filled with monsters that fear the power of Geo.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Normal_4","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["bloodstained-chivalry","noblesse-oblige","gambler","scholar"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Stone Chamber"}]},{"id":"sanctum-of-rainbow-spirits","n":"Sanctum of Rainbow Spirits","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Natlan","ty":"Artifacts","d":"It is said it was here that the sage in the form of a rainbow spirit once taught the warriors of the tribes the language of phlogiston. However, after the first Pyro Archon seized the authority of flame, the trials became unnecessary.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_NTCycle03","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["scroll-of-the-hero-of-cinder-city","obsidian-codex","resolution-of-sojourner","gambler"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: The Burning Gauntlet"}]},{"id":"ridge-watch","n":"Ridge Watch","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Mondstadt","ty":"Artifacts","d":"Those who are tough in spirit and body and who are not afraid of suffering pain shall gain the protection of this ritual site.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Cubic_Normal_4","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["tenacity-of-the-millelith","pale-flame","brave-heart","martial-artist"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Unyielding"}]},{"id":"faded-theater","n":"Faded Theater","t":"Domain of Blessing","region":"Fontaine","ty":"Artifacts","d":"The prophet and the ruler, heroes and fell dragons, the grand opera of the golden age once played out here.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_FDRelic01","rows":[{"days":[],"m":[],"a":["fragment-of-harmonic-whimsy","unfinished-reverie","brave-heart","scholar"],"nm":"Domain of Blessing: Variation"}]},{"id":"court-of-flowing-sand","n":"Court of Flowing Sand","t":"Domain of Forgery","region":"Inazuma","ty":"Weapon Ascension Materials","d":"Lurking at this altar where gold dust flows into eternity are enemies vulnerable to Geo attacks.","ic":"UI_DungeonPic_Rock","rows":[{"days":["Monday","Thursday","Sunday"],"m":["coral-branch-of-a-distant-sea","jeweled-branch-of-a-distan